#: ../Debconf/Element/Editor/Multiselect.pm:32
msgid ""
"(Enter zero or more items separated by a comma followed by a space (', ').)"
msgstr ""
"(Ievadiet nevienu vai vairāk elementus, atdalītus ar komatu un atstarpi (', "
"').)"

#: ../Debconf/Element/Gnome.pm:184
msgid "_Help"
msgstr "_Palīdzība"

#: ../Debconf/Element/Gnome.pm:186
msgid "Help"
msgstr "Palīdziba"

#: ../Debconf/Element/Noninteractive/Error.pm:40
msgid ""
"Debconf is not confident this error message was displayed, so it mailed it "
"to you."
msgstr ""
"Debconf nav pārliecināts, ka šis kļūdas paziņojums tika parādīts, tāpēc tas "
"tikai aizsūtīts jums uz e-pastu."

#: ../Debconf/Element/Noninteractive/Error.pm:67
msgid "Debconf"
msgstr "Debconf"

#: ../Debconf/Element/Noninteractive/Error.pm:90
#, perl-format
msgid "Debconf, running at %s"
msgstr "Debconf, strādā uz %s"

#: ../Debconf/Element/Select.pm:95 ../Debconf/Element/Select.pm:110
#, perl-format
msgid ""
"Input value, \"%s\" not found in C choices! This should never happen. "
"Perhaps the templates were incorrectly localized."
msgstr ""
"Ievada vērtība, \"%s\" nav atrasta C lokāles variantos! Tam nekad "
"nevajadzētu notikt. Varbūt sagatave tika nepareizi loklalizēta."

#: ../Debconf/Element/Teletype/Multiselect.pm:59
msgid "none of the above"
msgstr "neviens no minētajiem"

#: ../Debconf/Element/Teletype/Multiselect.pm:79
msgid "Enter the items or ranges you want to select, separated by spaces."
msgstr ""
"Ievadiet ar komatu atdalītus vienumus vai apgabalus, kurus vēlaties atlasīt."

#: ../Debconf/FrontEnd.pm:140
#, perl-format
msgid "Unable to load Debconf::Element::%s. Failed because: %s"
msgstr "Nevar ielādēt Debconf::Element::%s. Nezidevās, jo: %s"

#: ../Debconf/FrontEnd.pm:333
#, perl-format
msgid "Configuring %s"
msgstr "Konfigurē %s"

#: ../Debconf/FrontEnd/Dialog.pm:53
msgid "TERM is not set, so the dialog frontend is not usable."
msgstr "Nav uzstādīts TERM, dialoga fasāde nav lietojama."

#: ../Debconf/FrontEnd/Dialog.pm:56
msgid "Dialog frontend is incompatible with emacs shell buffers"
msgstr "Dialoga fasāde nav savietojama ar emacs čaulas buferiem"

#: ../Debconf/FrontEnd/Dialog.pm:59
msgid ""
"Dialog frontend will not work on a dumb terminal, an emacs shell buffer, or "
"without a controlling terminal."
msgstr ""
"Dialoga fasāde nestrādās uz dumjā termināla, emcs čaulas bufera, vai bez "
"kontrolējošā termināla."

#: ../Debconf/FrontEnd/Dialog.pm:107
msgid ""
"No usable dialog-like program is installed, so the dialog based frontend "
"cannot be used."
msgstr ""
"Nav instalēta neviena lietojama dialogu-veida programma, tāpēc nevar "
"izmantot dialogu bāzētu fasādi."

#: ../Debconf/FrontEnd/Dialog.pm:114
msgid ""
"Dialog frontend requires a screen at least 13 lines tall and 31 columns wide."
msgstr ""
"Dialogu fasādei nepieciešams ekrāns ar vismaz 13 rindiņām pa vismaz 31 "
"simbolam katrā."

#: ../Debconf/FrontEnd/Dialog.pm:331
msgid "Package configuration"
msgstr "Pakotnes uzstādījumi"

#: ../Debconf/FrontEnd/Editor.pm:94
msgid ""
"You are using the editor-based debconf frontend to configure your system. "
"See the end of this document for detailed instructions."
msgstr ""
"Jūs izvēlējāties konfigurēšanai lietot teksta redaktoru. Detalizētākas "
"instrukcijas ir atrodamas šī dokumenta beigās."

#: ../Debconf/FrontEnd/Editor.pm:111
msgid ""
"The editor-based debconf frontend presents you with one or more text files "
"to edit. This is one such text file. If you are familiar with standard unix "
"configuration files, this file will look familiar to you -- it contains "
"comments interspersed with configuration items. Edit the file, changing any "
"items as necessary, and then save it and exit. At that point, debconf will "
"read the edited file, and use the values you entered to configure the system."
msgstr ""
"Teksta redaktora konfigurācijas fasāde jums piedāvā rediģēt vienu vai "
"vairākus teksta failus. Šis ir viens to šādiem failiem. Ja esat pazīstams ar "
"standarta unix konfigurācijas failiem, šis fails jums izskatīsies pazīstams. "
"Tas satur komentārus pamīšus ar konfigurācijas rindām. Rediģējiet šo failu "
"un izmainiet nepieviešamās rindas, saglabājiet un aizveriet redaktoru. Šajā "
"brīdī debconf nolasīs izmainīto failu un izmantos jūsu ievadītās vērtības "
"sistēmas konfigurēšanai."

#: ../Debconf/FrontEnd/Gnome.pm:95
msgid "Really quit configuration?"
msgstr "Tiešām iziet no konfigurēšanas?"

#: ../Debconf/FrontEnd/Gnome.pm:96
msgid ""
"If you quit this configuration dialog, then the package being configured "
"will probably fail to install, and you may have to fix it manually. This may "
"be especially difficult if you are in the middle of a large upgrade."
msgstr ""
"Ja iziesiet no šī konfigurēšanas dialoglodziņa, visdrīzāk neizdosies "
"uzinstalēt konfigurēto pakotni un jums to vajadzēs salabot pašrocīgi. Tas "
"varētu būt īpaši grūti, ja esat lielas atjaunināšanas vidū."

#: ../Debconf/FrontEnd/Gnome.pm:96
msgid ""
"You may need to quit anyway if you are stuck in a configuration loop due to "
"a buggy package."
msgstr ""
"Jums varētu nākties tomēr iziet, ja esat iestrēdzis konfigurēšanas ciklā "
"pakotnes kļūdas dēļ."

#: ../Debconf/FrontEnd/Gnome.pm:97
msgid "_Quit"
msgstr "I_ziet"

#: ../Debconf/FrontEnd/Gnome.pm:98
msgid "Continue"
msgstr "Turpināt"

#: ../Debconf/FrontEnd/Gnome.pm:218
#, perl-format
msgid "Debconf on %s"
msgstr "Debconf uz %s"

#: ../Debconf/FrontEnd/Gnome.pm:238
msgid "_Next"
msgstr "_Nākamais"

#: ../Debconf/FrontEnd/Gnome.pm:245
msgid "_Back"
msgstr "Atpa_kaļ"

#: ../Debconf/FrontEnd/Readline.pm:47
msgid "This frontend requires a controlling tty."
msgstr "Šai fasādei nepieciešams kontrolējošais terminālis."

#: ../Debconf/FrontEnd/Readline.pm:62
msgid "Term::ReadLine::GNU is incompatable with emacs shell buffers."
msgstr "Term::ReadLine::GNU nav savietojams ar emacs čaulas buferiem."

#: ../Debconf/FrontEnd/Teletype.pm:99
msgid "More"
msgstr "Vairāk"

#: ../Debconf/FrontEnd/Web.pm:66
#, perl-format
msgid "Note: Debconf is running in web mode. Go to http://localhost:%i/"
msgstr ""
"Piezīme: Debconf strādā tīmekļa saskarnes režīmā. Atveriet pārlūkā "
"http://localhost:%i/"

#: ../Debconf/FrontEnd/Web.pm:166
msgid "Back"
msgstr "Atpakaļ"

#: ../Debconf/FrontEnd/Web.pm:168
msgid "Next"
msgstr "Nākamais"

#: ../Debconf/Template.pm:96
#, perl-format
msgid ""
"warning: possible database corruption. Will attempt to repair by adding back "
"missing question %s."
msgstr ""
"brīdinājums: datubāzes, iespējams, sabojāta. Mēģinās salabot, pievienojot "
"trūkstošo jautājumu %s."

#: ../Debconf/Template.pm:211
#, perl-format
msgid ""
"Template #%s in %s has a duplicate field \"%s\" with new value \"%s\". "
"Probably two templates are not properly separated by a lone newline.\n"
msgstr ""
"Sagatavē %s, vietā %s satur dublicētu lauku \"%s\" ar jauno vērtību \"%s\". "
"Iespējams divas sagataves nav pareizi atdalītas ar tukšu rindiņu.\n"

#: ../Debconf/Template.pm:236
#, perl-format
msgid "Unknown template field '%s', in stanza #%s of %s\n"
msgstr "Nezināms sagataves lauks: '%s', stanzā #%s no %s\n"

#: ../Debconf/Template.pm:262
#, perl-format
msgid "Template parse error near `%s', in stanza #%s of %s\n"
msgstr "Sagataves lasīšanas kļūda blakus '%s', stanzā #%s no %s\n"

#: ../Debconf/Template.pm:268
#, perl-format
msgid "Template #%s in %s does not contain a 'Template:' line\n"
msgstr "Sagatave #%s iekš %s nesatur 'Template:' rindiņu.\n"

#: ../dpkg-preconfigure:126
#, perl-format
msgid "must specify some debs to preconfigure"
msgstr "jānorāda daži deb-faili, lai iepriekškonfigurētu"

#: ../dpkg-preconfigure:131
msgid "delaying package configuration, since apt-utils is not installed"
msgstr "novēlo pakotņu konfigurēšanu, jo apt-utils nav uzstādīta"

#: ../dpkg-preconfigure:138
#, perl-format
msgid "unable to re-open stdin: %s"
msgstr "nevar no jauna atvērt stdin: %s"

#: ../dpkg-preconfigure:171 ../dpkg-preconfigure:183
#, perl-format
msgid "apt-extracttemplates failed: %s"
msgstr "kļūda darbinot apt-extracttemplates: %s"

#: ../dpkg-preconfigure:175 ../dpkg-preconfigure:187
#, perl-format
msgid "Extracting templates from packages: %d%%"
msgstr "Nolasa sagataves no pakotnēm: %d%%"

#: ../dpkg-preconfigure:197
msgid "Preconfiguring packages ...\n"
msgstr "Prekonfigurē pakotnes ...\n"

#: ../dpkg-preconfigure:209
#, perl-format
msgid "template parse error: %s"
msgstr "kļūda nolasot šablonu: %s"

#: ../dpkg-preconfigure:223
#, perl-format
msgid "debconf: can't chmod: %s"
msgstr "deboconf: nevar izpildīt chmod: %s"

#: ../dpkg-preconfigure:234
#, perl-format
msgid "%s failed to preconfigure, with exit status %s"
msgstr "neizdevās prekonfigurēt pakotni %s, kļūdas kods %s"

#: ../dpkg-reconfigure:100
msgid ""
"Usage: dpkg-reconfigure [options] packages\n"
"  -u,  --unseen-only\t\tShow only not yet seen questions.\n"
"       --default-priority\tUse default priority instead of low.\n"
"       --force\t\t\tForce reconfiguration of broken packages.\n"
"       --no-reload\t\tDo not reload templates. (Use with caution.)"
msgstr ""
"Lietošana: dpkg-reconfigure [opcijas] pakotnes\n"
"  -u,  --unseen-only\t\tRādīt tikai vēl neredzētus jautājumus.\n"
"       --default-priority\tIzmantot noklusējuma prioritāti, nevis zemo.\n"
"       --force\t\t\tPiespiest pārkonfigurēt salauztās pakotnes.\n"
"       --no-reload\t\tNepārlādēt veidnes. (Lietojiet piesardzīgi.)"

#: ../dpkg-reconfigure:112
#, perl-format
msgid "%s must be run as root"
msgstr "%s nepieciešams darbināt ar root tiesībām"

#: ../dpkg-reconfigure:139
msgid "please specify a package to reconfigure"
msgstr "lūdzu norādiet pakotni ko pārkonfigurēt"

#: ../dpkg-reconfigure:165
#, perl-format
msgid "%s is not installed"
msgstr "%s nav uzinstalēta"

#: ../dpkg-reconfigure:169
#, perl-format
msgid "%s is broken or not fully installed"
msgstr "%s ir sabojāta vai nav pilnībā uzsintalēta"

#: ../debconf-communicate:53
msgid "Usage: debconf-communicate [options] [package]"
msgstr "Lietošana: debconf-communicate [opcijas] [pakotne]"

#: ../debconf-mergetemplate:14
msgid ""
"debconf-mergetemplate: This utility is deprecated. You should switch to "
"using po-debconf's po2debconf program."
msgstr ""
"debconf-mergetemplate: Šī palīgprogramma ir novecojusi. Jums vajadzētu "
"lietot po-debconf pakotnes po2debconf programmu."

#: ../debconf-mergetemplate:66
msgid "Usage: debconf-mergetemplate [options] [templates.ll ...] templates"
msgstr ""
"Lietošana: debconf-mergetemplate [opcijas] [sagatavees.ll ...] sagataves"

#: ../debconf-mergetemplate:71
msgid ""
"\n"
"        --outdated\t\tMerge in even outdated translations.\n"
"\t--drop-old-templates\tDrop entire outdated templates."
msgstr ""
"\n"
"        --outdated\t\tSapludināt arī novecojušus tulkojumus.\n"
"\t--drop-old-templates\tIzmest visas novecojušās sagataves."

#: ../debconf-mergetemplate:119
#, perl-format
msgid "%s is missing"
msgstr "trūkst %s"

#: ../debconf-mergetemplate:123
#, perl-format
msgid "%s is missing; dropping %s"
msgstr "strūkst %s; atmet %s"

#: ../debconf-mergetemplate:146
#, perl-format
msgid "%s is fuzzy at byte %s: %s"
msgstr "%s ir neskaidri pārtulkots no %s baita: %s"

#: ../debconf-mergetemplate:151
#, perl-format
msgid "%s is fuzzy at byte %s: %s; dropping it"
msgstr "%s is neskaidri pārtulkots no %s baita: %s; atmet"

#: ../debconf-mergetemplate:168
#, perl-format
msgid "%s is outdated"
msgstr "%s ir novecojusi"

#: ../debconf-mergetemplate:173
#, perl-format
msgid "%s is outdated; dropping whole template!"
msgstr "%s ir novecojusi; atmet visu sagatavi!"

#: ../debconf:95
msgid "Usage: debconf [options] command [args]"
msgstr "Lietošana: debconf [opcijas] komanda [argumenti]"

#: ../debconf:97
msgid ""
"\n"
"  -o,  --owner=package\t\tSet the package that owns the command."
msgstr ""
"\n"
"  -o,  --owner=pakotne\t\tIzstādīt pakotni, kam pieder šī komanda."
